{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"519481","name":"Rome Kings Suite","description":"This lovely hotel is located in Rome, Italy, very close to the famous Via Veneto. The Rome Ciampino Airport is about 25-minute car ride away from the complex. Guests will be delighted by the beautiful surroundings full of a wide variety of restaurants, lovely cafes and bars with a unique atmosphere, and as well as many trendy shops where to look for shopping opportunities. Within easy reach, there are several cultural and historical sights that travellers cannot miss when they are visiting the city, the famous Trevi Fountain, the Piazza Navona and the Coliseum are just some of them and they all are at a walking distance. The rooms have been nicely decorated with a combination of light and warm colours to create a cosy atmosphere and make travellers feel comfortable. They are equipped with all the essential amenities to please each guest and give them the most pleasant and unforgettable stay. Check in is available from 2pm till 9pm, in order to give you the best welcome here, we would like to know your arrival time in advance, especially in case of arrivals later than 9pm. Please note, as per the Hotelbeds policy, there is an extra charge of € 30 for arrivals after 21:00.","address":"Via Francesco Crispi, 10","city":"ROME","countryCode":"IT","postalCode":"00187","lat":41.9031501814008,"lng":12.485622062565595,"stars":4,"giataCode":"530077","phone":"+39 06 45665169","email":"info@romekingsuite.com","website":"https://www.romekingsuite.com/","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/51/519481/519481a_hb_w_002.jpg","category":"room","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/51/519481/519481a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/51/519481/519481a_hb_a_005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/51/519481/519481a_hb_a_006.jpg","category":"